      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "AUSSIE TAN (2) finds it hard to win but looks close to breaking through. Has been in the minors the last two runs, the latest finishing third (17.52) at Northam. Top prospect. FEARLESS COBRA (7) finished second (17.53) two back at Mandurah but out of the placings last time when 6th there. Form here at the trip sound including two wins. Yet to win out of this box but has been in the placings two times from four starts. One of the better chances. BURNING KUNA (8) settled midfield in the run and boxed on to finish there when 4th (22.15) at this track. Form here at the trip sound including two wins. Cannot be taken lightly. LIKE A FERRARI (1) is likely to have admirers.",
